{"articleNo":"191767","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=191767&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[창업교육센터] 2018 창업발명 아이디어 경진대회 개최 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2018.04.26","hit":"3663","attachments":[{"name":"창업발명 아이디어 경진대회 신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=191767&attachNo=78975"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">안녕하세요 창업교육센터입니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">센터에서는 \"2018 창업발명 아이디어 경진대회\"를 개최하오니 많은 참여 부탁드립니다.</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">본 대회에서 대상을 수상하는 팀은 경북지역 22개 대학교 통합 경진대회인 \"제7회 G-Star 대학생 창업경진대회\"에 금오공과대학교 대표로 출전하는 자격이 부여될 예정입니다.</span></span></span></span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong>1. 대회명</strong> : 2018 창업발명 아이디어 경진대회</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong>2. 공모주제</strong> : 창의성 있는 창업 및 발명 아이디어(기술개발품 및 지식서비스)</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong>3. 참가대상</strong> : 재학생으로 구성된 개인 또는 팀(대학원생 포함)</span></span></span></span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong>4. 일정</strong></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 신청접수 : 5. 21.(월), 18:00까지</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 서류심사 : 5. 23.(수) ~ 5. 25.(금) 중 실시</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 발표심사 : 6. 1.(금) 예정</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 일정은 추후 사정에 의해 변경될 수 있습니다.</span></span></span></span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong>5. 접수방법</strong> : 붙임파일의 신청서를 작성한 후 </span></span></span></span></span></font><font color=\"#0900ff\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><u>메일송부 및 방문제출</u></strong></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 메일 : </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"mailto:startup@kumoh.ac.kr\">startup@kumoh.ac.kr</a></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - 방문 : 벤처창업관 313호</span></span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\">&nbsp; - </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum, 돋움\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">메일제목 및 파일명 :&nbsp;창업발명&nbsp;경진대회_팀명_팀장명_아이디어명</strong></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=